    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The Tasaba Lizardman Captain lives in the field of Innadril. At the command of the Water Dragon, Tasaba Lizardmen serving the Water Dragon Fafurion live in the field and keep the Land of Holy Water. He laments that the world is in the era of humans, and misses the past. Every time a full moon comes, he conducts a holy ritual dedicated to the Water Dragon. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
